---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Commerce Disclosure | Where Horses Run"
  description="Commerce disclosure for optional tip payments on Where Horses Run."
>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Payments</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Commerce Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="hero__summary">Information prepared for optional tip payments in Japan. Payment processing is not currently enabled.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-label="Commerce disclosure">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Legal name</h2>
      <p>Will be disclosed without delay if requested through the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page before payment is enabled.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Address</h2>
      <p>Will be disclosed without delay if requested through the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page before payment is enabled.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Telephone number</h2>
      <p>Will be disclosed without delay if requested through the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page before payment is enabled.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Email address</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:badjoke.lab@gmail.com">badjoke.lab@gmail.com</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Site and service</h2>
      <p>Where Horses Run is a free horse-racing information website operated under the badjoke-lab name. Optional tips are discretionary payments in appreciation for information and content already provided before payment. They are not donations, fundraising, crowdfunding, wagers, subscriptions, or payments on behalf of another person or organization.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Price and currency</h2>
      <p>If tips are enabled, the payer chooses the amount before payment. The applicable currency and total amount will be shown before the payment is confirmed. No recurring subscription is planned.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Additional charges</h2>
      <p>No shipping charge applies. Any internet access, mobile data, foreign-exchange, card-issuer, or other charges imposed independently by a user's provider are the user's responsibility.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Accepted payment methods</h2>
      <p>The payment methods actually enabled by Stripe will be displayed on the payment page before payment is confirmed.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Payment period</h2>
      <p>Card and other immediate payment methods are processed when the payer confirms payment. Any method with a different payment period will display that period before payment.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Delivery</h2>
      <p>No physical goods are shipped and no paid membership or future content entitlement is delivered in exchange for a tip. The tip relates only to free information and content already available on the site before payment.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Refunds and cancellation</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/refund/">Refund Policy</a>. For duplicate, mistaken, or disputed payments, use the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
